# TR-103 Documentation — what stays local
#
# Two folders, one job each:
#   PDFs/    the deliverables — these are committed and go to GitHub
#   LaTeX/   the editable sources — these stay on this machine only

# ── Stray source files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The site uses its own copy at site/assets/carrot-owl-logo.png, so this
# original in the root is not needed on GitHub.
COE LOGO.png

# ── Internal working documents ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Notes and instructions for preparing the documentation. They stay on this
# machine; they are not part of what goes to GitHub.
CLAUDE.md
plan.md
report-brief.md

# ── The official report ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Work in progress and not for GitHub. The whole folder, so nothing inside it
# can be committed by accident.
report/
report_details.json

# ── LaTeX sources ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The whole folder, so nothing inside it can be committed by accident.
LaTeX/

# Belt and braces: a .tex left anywhere else is still ignored.
*.tex

# ── LaTeX build artefacts ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Produced on every compile and never worth keeping.
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.toc
*.lof
*.lot
*.fls
*.fdb_latexmk
*.synctex.gz
*.bbl
*.blg
*.nav
*.snm
*.vrb

# ── Editor and OS noise ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*~
*.swp
